<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.alphalete.icd-onboarding-not-completed</string>

    <!-- WEEK 3, NEVER OWNER SUBMITTED: off the board as "Onboarding Not
         Completed" (Megan, 2026-11-25). The board used to record how
         onboarding ENDED and then never move, so somebody who finished
         classroom and drifted away a fortnight later read as a clean finish
         for ever. TIME KNOB: edit StartCalendarInterval here, not the
         wrapper.

         MONDAYS 07:40. Weekly, because the cohort it judges is a fixed week
         three weeks back and does not change inside the week. Monday
         morning, because that cohort's drug tests go out this week and the
         board has to be right before anybody is nudged to send them.

         :40 IS NOBODY'S MINUTE. The hourly board run owns :00/:15/:30/:45
         and the names run owns :05/:20/:50. Those two collided at nearly
         every fire until 2026-11-25 and the overlap guard was quietly
         skipping one of them, so a new job picks a minute on purpose and
         the collision test checks it.

         SHEETS ONLY. It reads the Owner Submit column the hourly ownerville
         step already wrote; it opens no OwnerVille and needs no browser.
         DRY until the chain goes live: the wrapper's MODE is "dry".
         Install: lucy rerun install_icd_onboarding_not_completed_agent machine "<Lucy N>" -->

    <!-- Path is the laptop placeholder; install_agent.py rewrites it to that
         machine's repo path. -->
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder/deploy/icd_onboarding_not_completed.sh</string>
    </array>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PYTHONPATH</key>
        <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder</string>
    </dict>

    <!-- 9:15pm EVERY DAY, machine LOCAL time. No Weekday key: a training day
         can fall on any day of the week, and the board is seeded from whoever
         is scheduled to start, not from a Monday.

         THE EVENING is the point. The training day has to have happened and a
         recruiter has to have marked the Show Up radio, so this runs after the
         office closes. It lands before the next morning's sends: Blue Ink goes
         out at 7:30am, and this is the column that stops it mailing documents
         to somebody who did not come (Megan, 2026-11-16: "run it daily").

         ONCE A DAY, not hourly, because it is the seven page calendar walk the
         hourly board run deliberately stopped doing. TIME KNOB: edit
         StartCalendarInterval here, not the wrapper.

         21:15, NOT ON THE HOUR. com.alphalete.icd-onboarding drives the same
         ApplicantStream profile, so the wrapper's own overlap guard skips
         this walk whenever the two meet. Set to 19:30 it met the board run
         every single night: it fired on time on 2026-11-19 at 19:30:05,
         skipped, and would have gone on skipping forever while looking
         installed. 21:15 falls between two board runs, and is still ahead of
         Blue Ink at 7:30am.

         WHAT THE BOARD'S CLOCK ACTUALLY IS, checked 2026-11-25: every hour
         ON THE HOUR, all 24 of them, plus extra passes at :15/:30/:45
         between 08:00 and 12:00 and on the half hour 12:00-14:30. This
         paragraph used to say ":30 of every hour from 6:30 to 20:30", which
         was true before the clock changed and then quietly was not — and
         the rule it gave ("go between the :30 fires") would now put a new
         time ON one. 21:15 happens to still be clear.

         So: any new time here goes BETWEEN the board's fires. Read them out
         of com.alphalete.icd-onboarding.plist rather than from this comment,
         which is a copy and will go stale again. -->
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Weekday</key>
        <integer>1</integer>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>7</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>40</integer>
    </dict>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder/output/logs/icd-onboarding-not-completed.launchd.out.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder/output/logs/icd-onboarding-not-completed.launchd.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
